    <h3 id="agent-work-inbox-summary"><span class="method method-get">GET</span> <span class="endpoint-path">/api/agent-work/inbox/summary</span></h3>
    <p class="endpoint-desc">Return counts for visible Inbox threads, unread client messages, and pending drafts for the connected staff user.</p>
