    <h3 id="agent-work-inbox-thread"><span class="method method-get">GET</span> <span class="endpoint-path">/api/agent-work/inbox/threads/:threadId</span></h3>
    <p class="endpoint-desc">Fetch thread profile, recent messages, and pending agent drafts. This is read-only and does not mark client messages read.</p>

    <h3 id="agent-work-inbox-draft"><span class="method method-post">POST</span> <span class="endpoint-path">/api/agent-work/inbox/threads/:threadId/draft</span></h3>
    <p class="endpoint-desc">Create a pending draft for staff review. This does not send anything to the client.</p>
