    <h3 id="agent-work-activity-log"><span class="method method-get">GET</span> <span class="endpoint-path">/api/agent-work/activity-log?date=2026-06-19&amp;include_summaries=true</span></h3>
    <p class="endpoint-desc">Return a firm-wide, append-only daily activity feed for agents. Use this before nightly workflow checks to find organizer submissions, document uploads, statement uploads, tax return delivery/signing activity, pipeline trigger movement, and cached client/Team Chat summaries. Requires <code>activity_log_read</code>.</p>
    <table class="params-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>date</td><td>date <span class="badge badge-optional">optional</span></td><td>Eastern business date, <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>. Defaults to today when <code>since</code>/<code>until</code> are omitted.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>since</td><td>date-time <span class="badge badge-optional">optional</span></td><td>Lower <code>occurred_at</code> bound for cursor-style reads.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>until</td><td>date-time <span class="badge badge-optional">optional</span></td><td>Upper <code>occurred_at</code> bound for cursor-style reads.</td></tr>
